9a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"크니?","meaning":"个子高","explanation":"크다：高；在 키가 크다 的语境中指个子高。-니 是非敬语疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크니","audio":"/audio/a79f5caa0509b5714e12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"由相同的父母生育或养育的子女们。","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高、个子","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人站直时从脚到头的高度；本句比较身高。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"高（个子高）","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"高度大于一般水平；这里指身高较高。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bffd7c65670c90d44ef.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79404-1-9-2","ko":"막내가 제일 커요.","zh":"最小的那个个子最高。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"막내가","meaning":"老小","explanation":"막내：老小；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"막내","audio":"/audio/012b502c679d38daad59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49941","senseId":"1","lemma":"막내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막내가","audio":"/audio/8f80a33b4bbc886e7592.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最。","readi